# HYBRID DARWIN/BLING PILOT: shortened to month-1 SOCAT only (matching
# the 1-month `data` nTimeSteps=2880), same mult_profiles(2-12,13)=0.0
# pattern used in the earlier BLING-only shortened-pilot run.
# profilesDoNcOutput disabled -- known intermittent crash
# ("Index '26' of dimension 1 of array 'varid'...") in
# profiles_init_ncfile.for, not needed since the cost is read directly
# from the patched ecco_cost file, not pkg/profiles' own NC export.

